; SALVATION UPON THE WICKED's chip on the Naga, for the rest of the scene (ruling 8): a plain Buff,
; until MANUAL (the default), VISIBLE - it is the only on-token sign that the protocol is running,
; and action_salvation_relock reads it by id, so it has to exist as a standalone buff_*.tres whether
; or not it were visible (buff_gather_round's reasoning). It carries its own name and effect rows.
; SP5: wears the SAME texture as action_salvation_upon_the_wicked.tres (the SALVATION family).
